        "created_at": "2017-11-12T04:01:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For the first one I’ve corrected the incaps for Akash’Thirya Spirit of the Void</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For Guise it depends on which card you are looking at. &nbsp;The original version lists 2 and the Foil alt art lists two&nbsp;</p>",
